# ouroboros round 116 / EigenScript#1059: `observe of <never-bound name>` was
# the one read-shaped form the VM tolerated (a silent no-observation tuple);
# on the a5bc350 pin it dies "undefined variable" like every other read, and
# the AOT's aot_observe_of now dies the same way instead of answering the
# tuple (t203 used to pin the tolerant answer). A bound name still observes.
x is 1
x is 2
print of observe of x
print of observe of never_bound
print of "unreachable"
